Error [jet.EffectBoundExceeded]: `quiet` uses the effect `IO`, which its signature doesn't allow
  --> tests/ui/effects/generic_instance_is_charged_to_caller.jet:14:30
    |
 14 | quiet: fn(t: Traced<Loud>) -[Net]> Int {
    |                              ^^^
  --> tests/ui/effects/generic_instance_is_charged_to_caller.jet:15:7
    |
 15 |     t.step()
    |       ^^^^ `Traced<Loud>` runs `Loud::work` here, which uses `IO`
 Why: The signature declares `-[Net]>`, so the body may only use those; `IO` is outside that set
 Fix: Add `IO` to the effect list, or stop using it in `quiet`
 Denial: invocation
 Call chain: quiet
